  "referenceNumber": "RUS3495",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that M9 LOGISTICS (HK) LIMITED is or has been \ninvolved in destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine by owning M9 LOGISTICS CO., LTD., which is or has been involved in destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, by making available goods or technology that could contribute to destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.\n \n",
